{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Logo.dev API",
    "description": "Logo.dev serves brand assets from two hosts, each with its own key:\n\n- **Logo.dev CDN** (`img.logo.dev`) returns a logo image. Authenticate with a **publishable key** in the `token` query parameter. It is safe in client-side code.\n- **Logo.dev API** (`api.logo.dev`) returns JSON. Authenticate with a **secret key** in the `Authorization: Bearer` header. Call it only from your server.\n\nGet your keys from the [dashboard](https://www.logo.dev/dashboard/api-keys).",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "contact": {
      "name": "Logo.dev Support",
      "email": "support@logo.dev",
      "url": "https://docs.logo.dev"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.logo.dev",
      "description": "REST APIs (Brand Search, Brand Data)"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Logo CDN",
      "description": "Logo images served from img.logo.dev. Authenticate with a publishable key in the `token` query parameter. Metered in CDN requests."
    },
    {
      "name": "Brands",
      "description": "Brand profiles, logos, and brandmarks as JSON from api.logo.dev. Metered in API credits."
    },
    {
      "name": "Logos",
      "description": "A brand's logo or brandmark as JSON, with a temporary download URL, dimensions, and a blurhash."
    },
    {
      "name": "Search",
      "description": "Find brands by name."
    },
    {
      "name": "Subscriptions",
      "description": "Choose which brands send you webhook events."
    },
    {
      "name": "Webhook endpoints",
      "description": "Manage the URLs that receive webhook events."
    },
    {
      "name": "Transaction Enrichment API",
      "description": "Turn a card transaction descriptor into a merchant identity. Private beta."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/{domain}": {
      "servers": [
        {
          "url": "https://img.logo.dev"
        }
      ],
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Logo CDN"
        ],
        "summary": "Get a logo",
        "description": "Get a logo image by domain, brand name, stock ticker, ISIN, crypto symbol, stock exchange, or market index.",
        "operationId": "getLogo",
        "security": [
          {
            "publishableKey": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "domain",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "The company's domain, such as `stripe.com`. For another lookup, replace `/{domain}` with a path from the table.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "examples": [
                "stripe.com"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/size"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/height"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/width"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/format"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/theme"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/greyscale"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/retina"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/fallback"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/redirect"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/LogoImage"
          },
          "202": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/CdnPending"
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/CdnBadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/CdnForbidden"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/CdnServerError"
          }
        },
        "x-mint": {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Get a logo image by domain, brand name, stock ticker, ISIN, crypto symbol, stock exchange, or market index."
          },
          "content": "<Card title=\"Get your API keys\" icon=\"key\" href=\"https://www.logo.dev/dashboard/api-keys\" horizontal arrow>\n  Your dashboard has a publishable key for the Logo.dev CDN and a secret key for the Logo.dev API. Every plan includes both.\n</Card>\n\nReturns a logo image. Put the identifier in the path. The query parameters work the same for every lookup.\n\n| Lookup | Path |\n| --- | --- |\n| Domain | `/stripe.com` |\n| Brand name | `/name/Stripe` |\n| Stock ticker | `/ticker/AAPL` |\n| ISIN | `/isin/US0378331005` |\n| Crypto symbol | `/crypto/BTC` |\n| Stock exchange | `/exchange/NYSE` |\n| Market index | `/index/SPX` |\n\n- For a ticker outside the US, add the exchange suffix, such as `7203.T`.\n- URL-encode a name that has spaces or special characters. `/name` also takes `strategy`: `match` (the default) for the closest name, or `suggest` for the most popular prefix match.\n- A lookup with no logo returns a generated monogram, unless you set `fallback=404`. A malformed ticker, crypto symbol, exchange, or index returns `400`."
        },
        "x-codeSamples": [
          {
            "lang": "html",
            "label": "By domain",
            "source": "<img src=\"https://img.logo.dev/stripe.com?token=LOGO_DEV_PUBLISHABLE_KEY\" alt=\"Stripe logo\" />"
          },
          {
            "lang": "html",
            "label": "By name",
            "source": "<img src=\"https://img.logo.dev/name/Stripe?token=LOGO_DEV_PUBLISHABLE_KEY\" alt=\"Stripe logo\" />"
          },
          {
            "lang": "html",
            "label": "By ticker",
            "source": "<img src=\"https://img.logo.dev/ticker/AAPL?token=LOGO_DEV_PUBLISHABLE_KEY\" alt=\"Apple logo\" />"
          },
          {
            "lang": "html",
            "label": "By ISIN",
            "source": "<img src=\"https://img.logo.dev/isin/US0378331005?token=LOGO_DEV_PUBLISHABLE_KEY\" alt=\"Apple logo\" />"
          },
          {
            "lang": "html",
            "label": "By crypto",
            "source": "<img src=\"https://img.logo.dev/crypto/BTC?token=LOGO_DEV_PUBLISHABLE_KEY\" alt=\"Bitcoin logo\" />"
          },
          {
            "lang": "html",
            "label": "By exchange",
            "source": "<img src=\"https://img.logo.dev/exchange/NYSE?token=LOGO_DEV_PUBLISHABLE_KEY\" alt=\"New York Stock Exchange logo\" />"
          },
          {
            "lang": "html",
            "label": "By index",
            "source": "<img src=\"https://img.logo.dev/index/SPX?token=LOGO_DEV_PUBLISHABLE_KEY\" alt=\"S&amp;P 500 logo\" />"
          },
          {
            "lang": "jsx",
            "label": "By domain",
            "source": "<img\n  src={`https://img.logo.dev/stripe.com?token=${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_LOGO_DEV_KEY}`}\n  alt=\"Stripe logo\"\n/>"
          },
          {
            "lang": "jsx",
            "label": "By name",
            "source": "<img\n  src={`https://img.logo.dev/name/Stripe?token=${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_LOGO_DEV_KEY}`}\n  alt=\"Stripe logo\"\n/>"
          },
          {
            "lang": "jsx",
            "label": "By ticker",
            "source": "<img\n  src={`https://img.logo.dev/ticker/AAPL?token=${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_LOGO_DEV_KEY}`}\n  alt=\"Apple logo\"\n/>"
          },
          {
            "lang": "jsx",
            "label": "By ISIN",
            "source": "<img\n  src={`https://img.logo.dev/isin/US0378331005?token=${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_LOGO_DEV_KEY}`}\n  alt=\"Apple logo\"\n/>"
          },
          {
            "lang": "jsx",
            "label": "By crypto",
            "source": "<img\n  src={`https://img.logo.dev/crypto/BTC?token=${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_LOGO_DEV_KEY}`}\n  alt=\"Bitcoin logo\"\n/>"
          },
          {
            "lang": "jsx",
            "label": "By exchange",
            "source": "<img\n  src={`https://img.logo.dev/exchange/NYSE?token=${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_LOGO_DEV_KEY}`}\n  alt=\"New York Stock Exchange logo\"\n/>"
          },
          {
            "lang": "jsx",
            "label": "By index",
            "source": "<img\n  src={`https://img.logo.dev/index/SPX?token=${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_LOGO_DEV_KEY}`}\n  alt=\"S&amp;P 500 logo\"\n/>"
          },
          {
            "lang": "bash",
            "label": "By domain",
            "source": "# Prints the status code and image type. The logo itself is not saved.\ncurl --silent --output /dev/null \\\n  --write-out \"%{http_code} %{content_type}\\n\" \\\n  \"https://img.logo.dev/stripe.com?token=LOGO_DEV_PUBLISHABLE_KEY&size=128&format=png\""
          },
          {
            "lang": "bash",
            "label": "By name",
            "source": "# Prints the status code and image type. The logo itself is not saved.\ncurl --silent --output /dev/null \\\n  --write-out \"%{http_code} %{content_type}\\n\" \\\n  \"https://img.logo.dev/name/Stripe?token=LOGO_DEV_PUBLISHABLE_KEY&size=128&format=png\""
          },
          {
            "lang": "bash",
            "label": "By ticker",
            "source": "# Prints the status code and image type. The logo itself is not saved.\ncurl --silent --output /dev/null \\\n  --write-out \"%{http_code} %{content_type}\\n\" \\\n  \"https://img.logo.dev/ticker/AAPL?token=LOGO_DEV_PUBLISHABLE_KEY&size=128&format=png\""
          },
          {
            "lang": "bash",
            "label": "By ISIN",
            "source": "# Prints the status code and image type. The logo itself is not saved.\ncurl --silent --output /dev/null \\\n  --write-out \"%{http_code} %{content_type}\\n\" \\\n  \"https://img.logo.dev/isin/US0378331005?token=LOGO_DEV_PUBLISHABLE_KEY&size=128&format=png\""
          },
          {
            "lang": "bash",
            "label": "By crypto",
            "source": "# Prints the status code and image type. The logo itself is not saved.\ncurl --silent --output /dev/null \\\n  --write-out \"%{http_code} %{content_type}\\n\" \\\n  \"https://img.logo.dev/crypto/BTC?token=LOGO_DEV_PUBLISHABLE_KEY&size=128&format=png\""
          },
          {
            "lang": "bash",
            "label": "By exchange",
            "source": "# Prints the status code and image type. The logo itself is not saved.\ncurl --silent --output /dev/null \\\n  --write-out \"%{http_code} %{content_type}\\n\" \\\n  \"https://img.logo.dev/exchange/NYSE?token=LOGO_DEV_PUBLISHABLE_KEY&size=128&format=png\""
          },
          {
            "lang": "bash",
            "label": "By index",
            "source": "# Prints the status code and image type. The logo itself is not saved.\ncurl --silent --output /dev/null \\\n  --write-out \"%{http_code} %{content_type}\\n\" \\\n  \"https://img.logo.dev/index/SPX?token=LOGO_DEV_PUBLISHABLE_KEY&size=128&format=png\""
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/name/{brand}": {
      "servers": [
        {
          "url": "https://img.logo.dev"
        }
      ],
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Logo CDN"
        ],
        "summary": "Get a logo by brand name",
        "description": "Returns the best-match logo for a brand name. URL-encode names with spaces or special characters. This is a convenience wrapper over Search that returns the top result's logo. See [Get a logo](/api-reference/logo-cdn/get-a-logo) for every lookup.",
        "operationId": "getLogoByName",
        "security": [
          {
            "publishableKey": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "brand",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "URL-encoded brand name.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "examples": [
                "shopify"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "strategy",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "`match` returns the closest name. `suggest` returns the most popular prefix match.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "match",
                "suggest"
              ],
              "default": "match"
            }
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/size"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/height"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/width"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/format"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/theme"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/greyscale"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/retina"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/fallback"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/redirect"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/LogoImage"
          },
          "202": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/CdnPending"
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/CdnBadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/CdnForbidden"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/CdnServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/ticker/{ticker}": {
      "servers": [
        {
          "url": "https://img.logo.dev"
        }
      ],
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Logo CDN"
        ],
        "summary": "Get a logo by stock ticker",
        "description": "Returns a company's logo for a stock ticker symbol. Defaults to US exchanges; append an exchange suffix for others (e.g. `AAPL.L`, `7203.T`). See [Get a logo](/api-reference/logo-cdn/get-a-logo) for every lookup.",
        "operationId": "getLogoByTicker",
        "security": [
          {
            "publishableKey": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "ticker",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Stock ticker symbol, optionally with an exchange suffix.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "examples": [
                "AAPL"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/size"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/height"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/width"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/format"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/theme"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/greyscale"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/retina"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/fallback"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/redirect"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/LogoImage"
          },
          "202": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/CdnPending"
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/CdnBadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/CdnForbidden"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/CdnServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
